-- Sun 24 May --

A new Car release is out, which fixes a major Symlink Attack vulnerability. Update now:
    $ su -c 'wget -O /usr/bin/car https://github.com/redroselinux/car/releases/latest/download/car'
    $ su -c 'chmod 755 /usr/bin/car'

Other than that:
    [converter] support arch packages
    [feature] new command why
    [feature] new command brake, release
    [feature breaking] system upgrades now follow our curated-rolling model
    [enhancement] improved command search
    [optimization] remove duplicate run of readFile()
